@node Files
@chapter Files

@cindex files
@table @file
@item ~/.config/cgra/config.cgra
User configuration, written by @command{cgra init}.
@item ~/.config/cgra/stdlib/
Bundled standard library (@pxref{Standard Library}).
@item ~/.config/cgra/conf.d/
Optional drop-in directory; @file{*.cgra} here load last, alphabetically.
@item ~/.config/cgra/.device
Port recorded by @command{cgra probe}, resolved by @samp{-d auto}.
@item /etc/cgra/
System-wide configuration (and @file{/etc/cgra/conf.d/}).
@item ./.cgra/
Project-local configuration, loaded unless @env{CGRA_CONFIG} is set.
@end table

@cindex see also
@section See also
@command{cgra(1)} (command reference), @command{cgra(5)} (the @file{.cgra} file
format), @command{libcgra(3)} (the C library).  The hardware report is in
@file{doc/build/main.pdf}; the wire protocol lives in
@file{hw/rtl/cgra_pkg.vhd}.
